  "Vow of Justice <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage to all foes, restore <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> HP to all allies and give all allies 1 stack of Blessing. gain [Truth], then gain [Clarity] for $3 turns. Under [Clarity], increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The light suddenly bloomed, and the aftermath of the explosion swept out, carrying endless light and power, causing indelible damage to the foe.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=24>Unjust Hunting Ground Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=24>Unjust Hunting Ground <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Curse damage to all foes, gain [Truth], then gain [Chaos] for $2 turns. Under [Chaos], decrease all foes' DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>, add $4 shot to [Arrow of Chaos] and increase [Arrow of Chaos] DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The scarlet spikes hidden underground were like a curse breaking out of the ground in the dark night, mercilessly binding the foe in this blood-colored cage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Golden Arrow Rain·Annihilate Lv.$1": "",
  "Golden Arrow Rain·Annihilate <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Use condition: When Akechi has [Truth]\\nSpend all [Arrow of Clarity] stacks, deal fixed Almighty damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of the damage recorded by each [Arrow of Clarity] stack. Then, activate [Arrow of Chaos] on random foes, dealing Almighty damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ($2 hits). From the second hit, prioritize new targets, and decrease damage to $4 for hits on the same target.\\nIf Akechi has [Detective Partner], [Arrow of Clarity] gains $5 of the Almighty damage of [Arrow of Chaos].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Justice is transformed into sharp arrows that inflict fatal damage on all foes, and any resistance and counterattacks will come to nothing in the face of justice.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage and <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK Curse damage to all foes, add $3 shots to [Arrow of Chaos] for $4 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Almighty damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
