  "The Dust Settles": "",
  "When using [Golden Arrow Rain·Annihilate], increase [Arrow of Clarity] recorded damage by $1. You now see all allies as [Detective Partner]. During battle, additionally gain Crit Rate and Crit DMG based $3 of highest Crit Rate and Crit DMG (Over $2) among all [Detective Partner] (Up to $4 and $5).": "",
  "Select <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally as the [Detective Partner]. When [Detective Partner] deal damage with an AoE {{B}} skill/HIGHLIGHT/Follow Up, records the average damage that dealt to the foes (Records $1 damage that dealt to the main target if it's a ST skill). At the start of your turn, gain 1 stack of [Arrow of Clarity] based on the total recorded damage and clears all recorded damage, [Arrow of Clarity] lasts for $2 turns.": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Bless damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes, restore $2 HP to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies and give all allies 1 stack of Blessing. gain [Truth], then gain [Clarity] for $3 turns. Under [Clarity], increase all allies' DMG Dealt by $4.": "",
