  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Curse damage to all foes, gain [Truth], then gain [Chaos] for $2 turns. Under [Chaos], decrease all foes' DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>, add $4 shot to [Arrow of Chaos] and increase [Arrow of Chaos] DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>.": "",
  "Use condition: When Akechi has [Truth]\\nSpend all [Arrow of Clarity] stacks, deal fixed Almighty damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of the damage recorded by each [Arrow of Clarity] stack. Then, activate [Arrow of Chaos] on random foes, dealing Almighty damage equal to $3 ($2 hits). From the second hit, prioritize new targets, and decrease damage to $4 for hits on the same target. If Akechi has [Detective Partner], [Arrow of Clarity] will deal a set amount of the Almighty damage of [Arrow of Chaos].": "",
